<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- BLANK based on TPB 99</book>
  <para style="ide"/>
  <para style="rem"/>
  <para style="h"/>
  <para style="toc3">Pl</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pl</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pl</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pilipai</para>
  <para style="mt2">Polue Pilipai</para>
  <para style="mt">xosa niki nakau xayawotai</para>
  <para style="imt">Akeri Kuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Ximuximu Polue xasi xusana Yurop masaira xowoyai yause xosa, nue xouna erewese Pilipai propinsi Masetonia xosa asinaku kuna uteiwotai. (Yesusupo Tianuwopi Teu 16.8-15 xekoa) Xurise xouna kire erewese purati kakauya atoro iyareteneai. Kakauya xosa purotai yause xosa kireu apimie Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai apimi Pilipai puroteneai nikau xonikisu pororinikepure xeteneaire kuna iyesetai. Pana pa nakau Polue Pilipai xesarinikeyai ninaxinukua, pa sapie kakeri Polupo xoukemu xoxixeki xekokixe. Xuwe. Nu Yesusureni xiri xousuna nimariri purotai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekime Polu nu xeara xiri xuweitauwati, Pilipai apimie nu tianuwopure xe xesauruwoneai. Pa xati Pilipai apimie kakeneai kapiaure Polue mua nakau xosa eiyaseniketai. Pa xeika, Polue kakauya xosa purinaxi xokupa nanunanu tineri xonikikemu xoxixetexina, ninipo xonikisu sokisokiwopure xetai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xoiteue nini kokaipa sapie xoniki iwoyaire Polue nini kaniketai. Paiya ninie Kristusu Yesusu xosa pa oma ekinikioma teteneai. Nue ipaki kunauna ninie Yuta nikau tu taiwoneaire pa sapie xoniki iwoneaixe. Xuwe. Ninie Yesusure kireni xonikisuwoneai. Pilipai apimie Kristusupo kapia tepinerire Polue xiri xouweiwotai. Kristusue nanuna ye iko kirenie kokaipa apu xina nukou nanunanuni taiwotaixe. Xuwe. Nu nukoini nuko touweina pa saina Xoiteue tuwoyai tetai. Polue ipaki kunauna Kristusu xeika xiri etokeneai xuiapu paiya, nini Xoiteupo xoukuru tirouneri xati, nini pani pani nimaririrouneri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sini mua nakau ninaxinuku paiya, Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu Pilipai erewese poroteneai Polue xiri xouweniketaire sipaunuku.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Pilipai kinie Polu xeikani lixeri Polue xiri nimaririwowotai</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PHP 1-4">Pl 1—4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:12-40">YT 16.12-40</ref></char></note> Poluno Timotino, sini Kristusu Yesusupo saina apimi, sinie tini Yesusu Kristusupo xokupa xuiapu erewese Pilipai purikiriai xeika tini yayakutua xeika tini saina apimi xeika xosa mua nakau xayaritikinuku. <verse eid="PHP 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Sikou Emisiki<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Ro 1.7</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 1:3">Ka 1.3</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:3">Pm 3</ref></char></note> Xoiteu xeika, Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeikae tinire xousuaxati xouwetikatia, tini xotiki kurunari purakuai.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Xoiteu eiyasewotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Ye xokupa yause<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:8">Ro 1.8</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:4">1 Ko 1.4</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:15-16">Ep 1.15-16</ref></char></note> tinire nanunanune paiya, yeu Xoiteu xosa eiyaseuroune. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Tini tianitikepure xokupa kunikuni kunikunixine paiya, ye sipesi nimaririne kunikuniroune. <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>Ye tinire nimaririroune, pa amure, tinie asinaku kuna uteiwopi saina xosa sini xeika lixinuku ximuximuni saina tipa kounuku kounuku mua yause xinuku. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:29">Yo 6.29</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:8">1 Ko 1.8</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:10">Pl 1.10</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:13">2.13</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:3">1 Ts 1.3</ref></char></note> panumu sipauweitiai, Xoiteu nukoini tini xosa asinaku saina sareyai xati, saina tixouna xounapa Kristusu Yesusupo Asau xosa pa saina xuweiyepina. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Tini yeu xoikemu tuporo purinuku, pa xati ye tinire mua asinaku nanunanu tuku xitiaia asinaku. Ye kakauya xosa puritire e ye asinaku kuna tianune sokisokiwopi saina titi rania Xoiteu nukoe yeure xousuaxati xouweina sietai saina xosa tini xokupae ye xeika lixinuku saina tikiriai. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:9">Ro 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 1:23">2 Ko 1.23</ref></char></note> nu muanumu sipa, Kristusu Yesusu nukou xousuae kakati ye saiyerati tini xokupa xeketikepure xiri xoieune.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Ye sipesi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:12">1 Ts 3.12</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:6">Pm 6</ref></char></note> ipakine kunikunine, tinipo ekitikioma xosa paiya kireu xotikienikepi kapiae xiri sokisoki xati, tini xokupa sipa tuku xaria, tinipo nanunanu xiri teteiwopinaxi kunikuniroune. <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>Kakatia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Ro 12.2</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:10">Ep 5.10</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:6">Pl 1.6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:16">2.16</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 3:13">1 Ts 3.13</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 5:14">Ip 5.14</ref></char></note> tinie xokupa kapia atinari uteinaria asinaku kapiani kutu takuai. Kakaria Kristusue xuiapu kuna xosa iyainikerepina Asau xosa, tini xiri xoseini kutu kire xu tuku purakuaixe. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Kakaria Yesusu Kristusue kapia kutu asinaku yararirounae tini xosa xiri koxepina. Kakati xuiapue xekerineri Xoiteu kokaipa wenumu tuneria nupo wenumu xourorepineri.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue kakauya xosa purati paie asinaku kuna tianuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Xatai xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:9">2 Ti 2.9</ref></char></note>, tini sipawakuaire ye kunaune, mua kapia ye xosai akipa xetai paiya, asinaku kuna parawatixe. Xuwe. Paie kakati asinaku kuna sokisoki xina. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">YT 28.30</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:1">Ep 3.1</ref></char></note> Sisaripo ata yakuwopineri xokupa xomatua kini xeika kireu apimi xokupa xeikae rania, ye kakauya xosa nikoe iyaiyereteneai nini sipa, pa amure, ye Kristusupo saina tine. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Kakiti xataimana nikau kokaipa apimi kinie, ye kakauya xosa puriti nanuworineri, paie ninipo xonikikemu sokisoki xati Kokaipa xosa sokisoki xonikisuneri. Kakineri ximikepi xuweu pani sokisoki xineri Xoiteupo kuna uteineri.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Suau, kireue xekoria apimie yeu wenimi xouroreri, paire xonikikemu tatauwati, yeu wenimi xororepure xeteneai, pa xotaparei sore ninie Kristusupo kuna uteiwoteneai. Pana kireua nini asinaku nanunanu tuku xati kuna uteiwoteneai. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Pa apimi nini sipa, ye asinaku kunapu saina sokisokiwopure kakauya xosa purine, pa xati yeure xiri xonikieineri kuna uteineri. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Pana kireu apimi paiya nikou weninikini xourorepure, Kristusupo kuna uteineri. Nini nanunanu asinaku kutu tukue kakerixe. Xuwe. Ye kakauya xosa puritia kireu xu pani xosai soxepure kakineri. <verse eid="PHP 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Pana nini asinaku nanunanu tukure e xoxi tuku rania, pa xokupa apimie Kristusupo kuna uteirouneri xati, paie kakati yeu xoikemu xiri nimaririna.<verse eid="PHP 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ye ekioma purineia Pilipai tianikepinexi Polue nanuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>Ye pani<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:11">2 Ko 1.11</ref></char></note> nimaririwopine, pa amure, ye sipa, Xoiteue tianiyepinaure tinie sipesi kunikunirounuku xati, Yesusu Kristusupo Youyae ye sokisokirouwatia, pa imerei Xoiteue tianiyati ye kakauya wetinei somo puropine. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:5">Ro 5.5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:19">8.19</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 6:19-20">Ep 6.19-20</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:16">1 Pi 4.16</ref></char></note> yei kire kapia xoxi kakerinei maya tepi xiraxine. Xuwe. Ye xokupa yause kakiroune sie, ximine xeika sewai xeika rania ye sokisokini kutu tumuneia asinaku asinaku kapia kireni kakepinexi nanune. Kakinei ekioma puropinere e xumutia, ye xokupa kapia kakitiaie Kristusu kokaipa wenumu tuwopina. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Yeu nanunanu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Ka 2.20</ref></char></note> paiya muanumu. Ye ekioma purineia, ye Kristusu xeika purine. Ye xumunei paiya, ye asinaku sapini kutu tepine. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Ye pani ekioma purineia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Ro 1.13</ref></char></note>, ye xokupa xuiapu tianikepine sie itou. Pana ye amu imerau taiwopine? Ye sipa xuwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:8">2 Ko 5.8</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:6">2 Ti 4.6</ref></char></note> paire aimore xoikemu tuku. Ye xounei Kristusu xeika puropineure ye xiri xoieune. Paiya xiri asinakuni kutu xepina. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Pana ye tini tianitikepineure, pani ouro puropinerau. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Panumu xati, ye sipa, ye xumopi xana xuwena, ye tini xeika puropine. Ye tini xeika puritia, tinipo xotikisue xiri sokisokina pani kokaipa xatia, tini nimaririwakauai. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Pa xati ye xiyeri kounei tini xosa putautia, tinie yeure nimaririnaria Kristusu Yesusupo wenumu xourorakuai.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue tini xeika purinana tini sokisoki purinare xu xemeroa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Kokaipa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:10">1 Ko 1.10</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:1">Ep 4.1</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:3">Pl 4.3</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:10">Kl 1.10</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:12">1 Ts 2.12</ref></char></note> sapi paiya, muai. Tinipo sesepi paiya kutuni asinaku purinari Kristusupo asinaku kunani kutu taiwakuai. Kakari ye kounei xeketikinere e tinire kuna kireni iyesine rania ye xemu sipauneia tini sokisoki tumunuku kireni xotikikemu purinuku, kireni nanunanu xeika asinaku kuna xeika xosa xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu sainikepure xirini saina tinukuxi sipawopine. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Tini kakixanari tinipo xiwaiyatikimanaure ximikaku. Tini xeketikeri ximikepu xuweuwaria, sini xuwexepinuku xineria, sipawopineri, pana Xoiteu nukoini kakatia tini xiri atinari purakuai. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Iyesa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:41">YT 5.41</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 5:3">Ro 5.3</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:8">Ep 2.8</ref></char></note>. Xoiteue tini atitikerina weitikitati tinie Kristusupo saina tinuku. Nue weitikitati Kristusu xosa kireni xotikisuwarixe. Xuwe. Tini weitikitati nukou wenumure xeika tatau xemenuku. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">YT 16.19-40</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:13">Pl 1.13</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:1">Kl 2.1</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:2">1 Ts 2.2</ref></char></note> tinie xekeyari ye xomai puritiai xoma xosa xomaxitiai, muaia ye pani xomai puriti yeu kuna tini iyesinuku. Paina tini tatau xemekiriai, pa amure, tini ye xeika lixinuku pa xoma xosa purinuku.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Sini kireni xosikikemu purinuku asinaku kapia kireu apimi xosa kakepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Kristusue tinipo xotikikemu sokisokirounare? Nue tini xiri xouwetikirouna xati paie kakati tinipo xotikikemu yoro purinare? Tini Xoiteupo Supo Youyapu ekeoma minika xosa purinukure? Tini kireu apimi xosa xotikisua xati xotikisuarei xotikienikirounukure? <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Panumu xatia, paina tini asinaku asinaku kapia kakari, yeu nimariri paie xiri koxepina. Tini xokupae kireni nanunanuni kutu tinari kireu apimi xotikiewopi kapia kireni taiwa. Kakinari kireni xotikikemuni kutu pura. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:10">Ro 12.10</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:26">Ka 5.26</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:21">Ep 5.21</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:15-16">Pl 1.15-16</ref>;<ref loc="JAS 3:14">Ye 3.14</ref></char></note> kakixanari takireni nanunanunari, takipo wenitiki xourorepi saina kireni taku. Xuwe. Tini takipo kapia ororinari, kireu apimi nikau kapiae sinipo kapia emeserinaxi nanuwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:24">1 Ko 10.24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:33">10.33</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:5">13.5</ref></char></note> takipo xuru kireni yakuwaku. Xuwe. Tini kireni kirenie takipo kireu xuiapu nikau xuru yakunari tianikari ati puropineri.<verse eid="PHP 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristusue nukou wenumu ororati, Xoiteue nu xouroretai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Kristusu Yesusu nukoe tipuroyai nanunanu sieni tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mt 11.29</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 13:15">Yo 13.15</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:21">1 Pi 2.21</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 2:6">1 Yo 2.6</ref></char></note> panumu nanunanuni kutu tipura. <verse eid="PHP 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Nu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-2">Yo 1.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:18">5.18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:33">10.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:5">17.5</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 4:4">2 Ko 4.4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:15">Kl 1.15</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:3">Ip 1.3</ref></char></note> Xoiteuni kutu purotaina pana, nu Xoiteu sie puropure pa kapia soki tepure nanuwotaixe. Xuwe. <verse eid="PHP 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Nu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Yo 1.14</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 8:9">2 Ko 8.9</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 4:4">Ka 4.4</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 2:14">Ip 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:17">2.17</ref></char></note> pa kapia wetina nu aipu saina apu sie sayetai. Nu apu sie putauna, <verse eid="PHP 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>apuni<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mt 26.39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:42">26.42</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 10:17-18">Yo 10.17-18</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 8:3">Ro 8.3</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 5:8">Ip 5.8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:2">12.2</ref></char></note> kutu purati apimie xekoteneai. Kakina nukoini nuko ororina Xoiteupo kuna taipa xouna xumotai yause xetai, iyo, kakipa xouna na nikitoto xosa xumotai. <verse eid="PHP 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Pa xotaparei<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:1-5">Yo 17.1-5</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 2:33">YT 2.33</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:20-21">Ep 1.20-21</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:3-4">Ip 1.3-4</ref></char></note> sore Xoiteue Yesusu xourorina xiri xouroni kutu iyarati purina. Kakina Xoiteue kireu kireu weniniki emeserinikina kire wenumu xouroni kutu tuwotai. <verse eid="PHP 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mt 28.18</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 14:11">Ro 14.11</ref>;<ref loc="REV 5:13">XKY 5.13</ref></char></note> pa wenumu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Ais 45.23</ref></char></note> Yesusu tuwotai xati, xokupa sapie mena xouro puroto ouro puroto ou minika puroto woteneai sapi xeikae Yesusu xekero xonikitapa urukurouneri nu irue puropineri. <verse eid="PHP 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>Kakati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:13">Yo 13.13</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 2:36">YT 2.36</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 10:9">Ro 10.9</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 Ko 8.6</ref></char></note> nini xokupae ipaki kunauneria, “Yesusu Kristusu nu Kokaipa,” xepineri. Pa kapiarei Xoiteu Emisiki kokaipa wenumu tuwopineri.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sini memeremu sie xuiapu xopuro puropu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Paina<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:11">Siri 2.11</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 6:5">Ep 6.5</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:5">Pl 1.5</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:17">1 Pi 1.17</ref></char></note>, yeu xatai xura ye tinire xoi xumuna, tinie yeu kuna sipesi tairounuku xati, ximine rania panumu kaka. Ye tini xeika puritia pa yause xosa kireni kuna taiwaku. Xuwe. Ximine ye xetauro purinena, tini atinarini kutu kuna taiwa. Xoiteue tini xiyeri titiketai xati, muaiya tini urewoto ximiketeunari pa xotiki iwopure xetai sapini kutu takuaire sokisoki saina ta. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Siko<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:5">Yo 15.5</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:6">1 Ko 12.6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:10">15.10</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 3:5">2 Ko 3.5</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:13">1 Ts 2.13</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:21">Ip 13.21</ref></char></note> sipa, Xoiteu nukoe tinipo xotikiro saina tirouna. Nukoini xouwewotai kapia tinie kakakuaire tinipo xotikikemu sarirouna.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1">Ro 14.1</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 10:10">1 Ko 10.10</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:9">1 Pi 4.9</ref></char></note> xokupa kapia kakinaria, tini peuni purinari kaka. Tini kakixanari xekepi kunaunari kuna tuwataxaku. <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15-16"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Tu 32.5</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 49:4">Ais 49.4</ref>;<ref loc="DAN 12:3">Tan 12.3</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 5:14-16">Mt 5.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:45">5.45</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:16">10.16</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 2:2">Ka 2.2</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:1">Ep 5.1</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:8">5.8</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:10">Pl 1.10</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:19">1 Ts 2.19</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 3:5">3.5</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Pi 2.12</ref></char></note> Xoiteupo nonoe panumu kakinaria, tini ati purinari xoxixoxi kapia xuweu xu xuweu purakuai. Kakinari ekeoma tuku kuna soki tinaria, mua ouropu xuiapu xopu memeremu sie purakuai. Pa xuiapu kinie asinaku kapiani kutu wetineri xoxixoxi kapia kaketeneai. Pa xati Kristusue xiyeri kopina yause xosa yei tinipo kapiaure xiri nimaririwopine. Kakine sipauneia, yei tini xopu irereiyai saina paiya, ye aini kakepu xuwexi sipawopine.<verse eid="PHP 2:15-16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Tinipo xotikisu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:16">Ro 15.16</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:6">2 Ti 4.6</ref></char></note> paiya tini Xoiteu xouieunuku. Ye panumu sipaunei xisae xoniki irouneri sie yeu yawi xeika tinie Xoiteu xouikiriai kapia xeika kusaworia ye paire nimaririwopine. Ye tini xeika nimaririwopine. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Panumu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:1">Pl 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:4">4.4</ref></char></note> sie tini rania nimaririwakuai. Tini ye xeika xiri nimaririwakuai.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Pilipai Timoti xesawopure kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Kokaipa Yesusupo nanunanu xatia, tini xosa Timoti xesawopure xenenewopixe. Nue xiyeri kouna tinire kayatia, ye xiri xoi meruxepine. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Timoti sie apua kire yue ye xeika puratixana xuwe. Nu sipesi ye xeika lixina tini tianitikepure nanunanuna ime xirekirouna. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Xokupa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:24">1 Ko 10.24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:33">10.33</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:5">13.5</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Ti 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:16">4.16</ref></char></note> kireu apimie nikou xurureni eiyo xineri, Yesusu Kristusupo saina pani tipa xowopi nini xiraxirouneri. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">1 Ko 4.17</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 1:2">1 Ti 1.2</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 1:2">2 Ti 1.2</ref></char></note> Timotipo asinaku kapia tini sipa. Tini sipa, nonoe omo tianurouna sie nue asinaku kunapu saina tianiyeyai. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Pa xati ye xosai amu kapiarau yaraxepinana ye xayaka xayaka yakune siparineye, xurise tini xosa xesautia sapauni utopina. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Kokaipae ime taiyepinaxi xoisunena, iko rania xayaxayaka xurise kouneia xeketikepine.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Epaprotitusi Pilipai xesawopure kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Tini xosa Epaprotitusi xesautia utopinaureni kutu ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:18">Pl 4.18</ref></char></note> nanune. Nu sikou xatasiki, nu pa xoma xosaupo saina emei nu liemei, nu takie xesawari ye tianiyepinaure koyai. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Nu tinire xiri eiyoxina xeketikepurexina. Nu supa tuku kuna tinie iyesari, paire nu siparina xoukemu tatauna. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Suwau, ekime xoia supa tina xiri xumopure xetai. Pana Xoiteue nure xousuawati ekemiri kusawetai. Xoiteue nure kireni xousuaxepu xuwe. Yeure rania xousuaxetai, pa amure, kokaipa xuni kutu ye xoroyepi xirarina kaketai. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Pa xati nu xiyeri xekerinari nimaririwakuaire, nu xesautia utopina. Kakineia iko rania ere xoikemu tatauwopuwatixe. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:16-18">1 Ko 16.16-18</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 5:17">1 Ti 5.17</ref></char></note> tinie Kokaipapu wenumurei Epaprotitusi sowopure xiri nimaririwa. Tini panumu apimi xosa kokaipa weniniki tinika. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:17">1 Ko 16.17</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:10">Pl 4.10</ref></char></note> Kristusupo saina tina xiri xumopurexetai. Nu nuko asinaku puropinaure nanuwotaixe. Xuwe. Ye tianiyepina saina takie tukiriai xosa kireni nanunanuna, kakina nupo supa sokau porouna pani saina tina.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Apue Kristusure xousuna paiya nu apu kutu asinakuni kutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Xatai xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:11">2 Ko 13.11</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 2:18">Pl 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:4">4.4</ref></char></note>, ye mua kuna xuweiyepure ipaki kunawopurexine, tini Kokaipaureni kutu nimaririwa. Ye mua kuna tini xosa xiyeri xayawopure ouyexixe. Xuwe. Pa amure, nue tini tianitikepinaxi nanune.<verse eid="PHP 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Apimie mamumamu sie saina xoxi tirouneri xosa sosopa epixakuai<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:16">Siri 22.16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:20">22.20</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 2:28">Ro 2.28</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 11:13">2 Ko 11.13</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:2">Ka 5.2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:15">5.15</ref>;<ref loc="REV 22:15">XKY 22.15</ref></char></note>. Paiya pa apimie nanuneri Israili nikau kapiarei siko xokupa sikau mupusiki xoxixoxiwopuxi kakineri. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Siko<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Ro 2.29</ref></char></note> kireni Xoiteupo Israili kinini kutu purinuku mupusiki kesewopi kapiani kutu tainuku. Kakinuku Xoiteupo Youyapu sokisokirei sini Xoiteure muris tinuku Yesusu Kristusupo wenumu xourorirounuku. Sini sipa, apimie mupunikire sapi kaketeneai paiya, nini xayakaxayaka tianikepuwatixe. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Iyesa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:18">2 Ko 11.18</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:21-29">11.21-29</ref></char></note>. Mupusikipo sapie sini tianisikepina itou xatia, iko paiya ye atineni kutu puropine. Apimie mupunikiropu kapia xosaniki moati nimaririwoneai paiya yei xiri emeserinikine. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Anikae<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:59">Lu 1.59</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 23:6">YT 23.6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26.5</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ro 11.1</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 11:22">2 Ko 11.22</ref></char></note> ye iyaiyerati, 8-teu asau xosa mari takeriyeneai. Ye Israilipo apu. Ye Pensaminipo apu kini. Ye yeu xauwa anika sieni, Ipru kuna kunauroune. Ye Parisi nikau kapiarei tuxotapa atineni kutu tairoune. <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">YT 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22.4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9-11</ref></char></note> Xoiteupo saina tepure xiri sokisokine, pa xati yei ekime Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu xosa xoxi kapia kakiyai. Apimie tuxotapapu kunaure nanuworineri yeu kapia uteineria, ye xu xuwe. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:44-46">Mt 13.44-46</ref></char></note> kunauweitiai, ye mua mupusikipo kapia kapiapu ime taineia, yei kireu apimi xiri emeserinikepine. Pana ye mua xokupa sapi xekeutia aipu sapi sie xati, ye Kristusupo ime taine. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23-24">Yer 9.23-24</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 2:2">1 Ko 2.2</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:2">Kl 2.2</ref></char></note> mua Yuta nikau kapia kirenire kunauixe. Xuwe. Ye Kristusu Yesusu sipa, nu yeu Kokaipa xati, ye pa sapi kireni xekeuia xiri asinakuni kutuna, mua ouropu xokupa asinaku sapi paiya aipu inaina sie. Ye Kristusu kireni taiwopure ye xokupa kireu sapi wetine, Kristusu soki tineia <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>nu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-22">Ro 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:30">9.30</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:3-6">10.3-6</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 2:16">Ka 2.16</ref></char></note> xeika lixepine. Ye tuxotapa taiwopure ikoini kakitiai kapiae apu kutu asinaku sayepinexi nanuixe. Xuwe. Ye xetau imerei apu kutu asinaku sayepurexine, paiya Kristusu xosa xoisuwopine ime. Sini Kristusure xosikisukiri Xoiteu nukoini wenisikina kutu asinaku xuiapu xirouna. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:3-5">Ro 6.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:17">8.17</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 4:10-11">2 Ko 4.10-11</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 6:17">Ka 6.17</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 2:11-12">2 Ti 2.11-12</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:13">1 Pi 4.13</ref></char></note> Kristusu sipawopureni kutuxine. Kristusue kopa upuropu saroyaina, nu kokaipa sokisoki tuku xati, pa nupo sokisoki ye xiri sipawopurexine. Ye tatau xemeropi kapiaure nu xeika lixepurexine. Kakine nue xumuna nanunanu tipuroyai sie ye panumu nanunanu sie tipuropurexine, <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:14">Lu 14.14</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 4:2">YT 4.2</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:16">1 Ts 4.16</ref>;<ref loc="REV 20:5-6">XKY 20.5-6</ref></char></note> ye rania kopa upuropu xiyeri saropinexi nanune.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue atu xosa sokisoki keikei xourouna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:5-6">YT 9.5-6</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 6:12">1 Ti 6.12</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:19">6.19</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 12:23">Ip 12.23</ref></char></note> Kristusupo pa kapia tieine, ye apu asinakuni kutu sainexi nanuixe. Xuwe. Pana Kristusu Yesusue soki tiyeyai sie, sipesi yei pa kapia soki tepi saina tine. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Xatai xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24-26">1 Ko 9.24-26</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 5:16">2 Ko 5.16</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 6:1">Ip 6.1</ref></char></note>, ye nanutiaiya ye pa kapia xemu titixe. Pana ye kire nanunanu tuku kireni, paiya ekimepu xokupa kapia wetinei, pa sapi sewai putawopina tepure sokisoki saina tepine. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24">1 Ko 9.24</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:7-8">2 Ti 4.7-8</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 3:1">Ip 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:1">12.1</ref></char></note> atu xosa putaunei asinaku misepi tepineure sokisoki keikei xouroune. Pa asinaku misepi paiya muanumu. Kristusupo saina xosa, ye xouro xounei Xoiteu nuko xeika xiri ati misepineure yaiyetai.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Sinipo nanunanue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:6">1 Ko 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 14:20">14.20</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:10">Ka 5.10</ref></char></note> asinaku sipa tuku apimi nikau nanunanu sie xatia, paina sini xokupae ye mua uteitiai sie nanunanu taiwopu. Tini xetau nanunanu tuku xatia, paina Xoiteue pa tinipo nanunanu kutuworepina. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:16">Ro 12.16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:5">15.5</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 6:16">Ka 6.16</ref></char></note> sini pa asinaku kapia tieikiriaia, sini sokisokini kutu tepu.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Xatai xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 Ko 4.16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11.1</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:9">Pl 4.9</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:6-7">1 Ts 1.6-7</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:3">1 Pi 5.3</ref></char></note>, tini xokupae yeu kapiani kutu taiwa. Kakinari pa apimie sinipo kapia tairouneri atinari xekenika. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:23">1 Ko 1.23</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 1:7">Ka 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:21">2.21</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:12">6.12</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:15-16">Pl 1.15-16</ref></char></note> xousua tuku, xokupa apimie Kristusupo na nikitotopu xiwai purineri. Xokupa yause ninipo kapia paire katikitiai xati, ximine ye xiyeri katikiti, ekirei morepi waxi kiririna. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Nikou<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:5-6">Ro 8.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:18">16.18</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 11:12">2 Ko 11.12</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:15">11.15</ref>;<ref loc="2PE 2:1">2 Pi 2.1</ref></char></note> mupunikie xonikiewotai kapiani tairouneri xati, pa xonikiewoteneai kapiae ninipo xoiteu sie purina. Ninie sipesi ouropu sapire kireni nanunanurouneri xati, xoxixoxi kapia maya tuku kakepure nimaririrouneri. Pa apimia nini xepi xosa xuwexepineri. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:6">Ep 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:19">2.19</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:10">1 Ts 1.10</ref></char></note> siko paiya, sini mena xouropu xuiapu purinuku. Sini Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusue mena xouro wetina xiyeri kou tisikepinaure yakunuku. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Nukou sokisokireini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Ro 8.29</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 15:28">1 Ko 15.28</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:43-53">15.43-53</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:19">Ep 1.19</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:4">Kl 3.4</ref></char></note>, Kristusue kakati xokupa sapi nu irue puratia, pa sokisoki kirenie pa xu sikirouna mupusiki pirixepina, kakatia sinipo mupusiki paiya nukou mupokemu sieni xiri xoseini kutu xoseixepina.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s">Sini kireni xosikieni nimaririnuku asinaku nanunanu tepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:19-20">1 Ts 2.19-20</ref></char></note>, yeu xatai xura, ye kunautiai sie, tini Kokaipa xosa sokisokini tumuwa. Yeu xoikemu tini tikiroune xati, tinire ye xoikemu xiri pirixina. Tini paiya yei sokisoki saina tine asinaku sapi tiyai sie xati, tinire ye pani nimaririroune.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Yuotiano Sintikeno, tini iyesaxa. Tini xui axirini Kokaipapu kini xosaupo, pa xati tini kirenini xotikikemuwaxa. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Ne<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Siri 69.28</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 10:20">Lu 10.20</ref>;<ref loc="REV 3:5">XKY 3.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">20.12</ref></char></note>, ne yeu saina emeini kutu, ye ne kanine, ne mua xui aimore tianike. Asinaku kuna uteiwopi saina xosa ninie ye xeika atineri lixeteneai. Klemeni xeika kireu saina emeumana xeikae sini xeika saina teteneai. Pa xokupa kini nikau weniniki paiya ekisikoma puropu nakau xosa purina.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Tini sipesi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:12">Ro 12.12</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 3:1">Pl 3.1</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:16">1 Ts 5.16</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:13">1 Pi 4.13</ref></char></note> Kokaipaureni nimaririwa. Ye xiyeri kunaune, tini xiri nimaririwa.<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:25">Ip 10.25</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:37">10.37</ref>;<ref loc="JAS 5:8-9">Ye 5.8-9</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:7">1 Pi 4.7</ref>;<ref loc="2PE 3:8">2 Pi 3.8</ref></char></note> xokupa apimi peuni peuni nikari ninie tinipo asinaku kapia xekopineri. Nanuwa. Kokaipa kopure tomuroirouna. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:3">Asin 16.3</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mt 6.25-34</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Lu 12.22-31</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:2">Kl 4.2</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:7">1 Pi 5.7</ref></char></note> kire sapire eiyo xaku. Xuwe. Tinipo xokupa xure sipesi Xoiteu kauna. Tini Xoiteu xosa kunikuninari eiyase kuna kaunari, tianitikepinaure kotowa. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Xoiteue xosiki yoro<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:3">Ais 26.3</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 14:27">Yo 14.27</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 5:1">Ro 5.1</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:15">Kl 3.15</ref></char></note> sini sikirouna paiya, asinaku sapini kutu xati, sini apue paire xotapani kutu sipawopu xana xuwe. Xoiteue kakati tinipo xotikikemu yoroni purinaria, pa kapiae tini Kristusu Yesusu xeika atinari etokaria, tinipo xotikikemu xeika nanunanu xeika atina kutuni puropina.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Xatai xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:17">Ro 12.17</ref></char></note>, ye kire kuna pani kunawopurexine. Tini xokupa yause suau kapia kirenire nanunari, apimie asinaku kapia kaketeneaire nanunari, kutu kapiaure nanunari, asinaku teteiwoki kapiaure nanunari, sapi xoseixoseire nanunari, asinaku asinaku sapini kuture nanunari, xokupa kapia akerekire nanunari, apimie xokupa kapia kakeri siko apue xekeri xiri nimaririrounuku xeikaure nanuwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Tini xokupa kapia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:20">Ro 16.20</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 14:33">1 Ko 14.33</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 3:17">Pl 3.17</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:23">1 Ts 5.23</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:20">Ip 13.20</ref></char></note> kakakuaire ye uworitikiyai paiya ati siparinuku, xokupa kapiaure ye kuna uteiti tinie iyesinuku pani kakiti xekeukiriai, pa xokupa kapia tini sipesi kakakuai. Kakaria Xoiteu, nu xosikemu yorowopu kapia xotapa, nue tini xeika puropina.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilipai apimie Polu xouineri xuru xesaruwoteneaire nimaririwotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Tinie ye xiyeri tianiyepure nanunanu tari, ye Kokaipa xosa xiri nimaririne. Suau, ekime tinie ye tianiyepure nanunanukiniaina pana, ye tianiyakuai ime xuwe. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:6-8">1 Ti 6.6-8</ref></char></note> sapiara xuweitauyati mua kuna kunauixe. Xuwe. Ye amu kapiae xosai moatia, ye peuni puropi kapia sipauweitiai. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:11">1 Ko 4.11</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 6:10">2 Ko 6.10</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:27">11.27</ref></char></note> xiri xauna purinere e ye xokupa sapi tukuxine rania, ye peuni puriroune. Ye xokupa xoye tukure e ye iriapu puropine, ye xokupa sapi tukure e ye sapiara xuweitauyepina rania ye peuni puropi kapia sipauweitiai. Xokupa sapi ye xosai putawopina, pana ye pani peuni purine xoikemu asinaku xiroune. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Kristusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:5">Yo 15.5</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 12:9-10">2 Ko 12.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:17">2 Ti 4.17</ref></char></note> ye sokisokirouna xati, nupo sokisokie ye xokupa sapi kakepine itou.<verse eid="PHP 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Ye ipaki kunaune tinie ye tianikiriai kapiaure ye nimaririne xitiaia, pa amure, ye xu xemetiai yause xosa tinie ye xeika lixepure nanuworinuku, mua asinaku kapia kakikiriai. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Ko 11.9</ref></char></note> Pilipaipo xuiapu, takieni sipaukiriai, ye asinaku kuna uteiwopi saina xotapa taiyeine, Mesetonia Propinsi wetitia, kireu Yesusure xonikisurouneri apimie ye xeika lixineri xeara tianineri siepineri kapia xuwexetai. Xuwe. Tini kirenie panumu kakikiriai. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Ye Tesalonaika erewese puriyai yause<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">YT 17.1</ref></char></note> xosa, tinie xayaka xayaka xokupa yause tianikiriai. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Tini kakixanari nanunari, tinie ye xoi iwakuaire kototikine xaku. Xuwe. Tinipo asinaku kapiae pani kokaipa xati, Xoiteue tini xosa asinaku kapia kakepinaure ye xoieune. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">XT 29.18</ref>;<ref loc="EZK 20:41">Ese 20.41</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 9:12">2 Ko 9.12</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:2">Ep 5.2</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 2:25">Pl 2.25</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:16">Ip 13.16</ref></char></note> tinie xokupa sapi Epaprotitusu xuporo iyari kotai paiya ye itou titiai. Kakari ye xokupa sapi tuku xine paie koirotai. Tinie xuru xesawari kotaia xokupa ekeu emeserina. Tinipo xuru paiya Xoiteu xouiwopu sapi asinaku xuri tuku sie, tini Xoiteu tukiriai. Xoiteu xouiwopure panumu kakeria nu panumu tepure xiri nimaririrouna. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Yeu Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Siri 23.1</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 9:8">2 Ko 9.8</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:7">Ep 1.7</ref></char></note> siko Kristusu Yesusupo xuiapu sikau xokupa sapi asinaku asinaku akituworisiketai. Pa xati tini sapi xuweitautiketaia nukoe xokupa sapi xiri xousokuworitikepina. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:27">Ro 16.27</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 1:5">Ka 1.5</ref></char></note> nu sikou Xoiteu nu sikou Emisiki xati, sini nupo wenumu sipesi sipesi xourorepu. Pa suau.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Pilipai apimi kuso kuna tiniketai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Tini Kristusu Yesusupo xuiapu xosa kuso kuna tikine. Ye xeika puroteneai xataimanae, tini xosa asinaku asau xeteneai. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Xoiteupo xuiapu xokupae<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:13">Pl 1.13</ref></char></note> tini xosa ipaki kuso kuna kunauneri asinaku asau xeri, Sisaripo atoro saina tirouneri pa apimi kinie, yei tini asinaku asau kuna tikepineure sokisoki kuna kayeteneai.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusue xousuaxina xouwesiketai kapiae tini xokupa xosa puropina.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
